<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Meter Test Covering Letter</title>
    <style>
      /* fonts via base-report.css; margins via report-print-base.css */
      /* No letterhead: the client's letter is a plain page with the company stamp. */

      body {
        font-size: 10.5pt;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }

      .letter-date {
        text-align: right;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .letter-to {
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      .letter-subject {
        padding-left: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .letter-body p {
        text-align: justify;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .letter-close {
        margin-top: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .details div {
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .details .gap {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 28px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="pdf-wrapper">
      <div class="pdf-page">
        <div class="letter-date">Date: {{generated_on}}</div>

        <div class="letter-to">
          To,<br />
          The Executive Engineer,<br />
          M.S.E.D.C.L
        </div>

        <div class="letter-subject">Subject: Testing of Generation meter with/without CT</div>

        <div class="letter-body">
          <p>Respected Sir,</p>
          <p>
            I undersigned, <strong>{{vendor_name}}</strong>, installing for Mr/Mrs/Miss
            <strong>{{consumer_name}}</strong>, who has received sanction for solar roof top net
            metering ref no <strong>{{sanction_number}}</strong> dated
            <strong>{{formatDate sanction_date}}</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>So I request you to test the Generation Meter with/without CT.</p>
          <p>Kindly do the needful.</p>
        </div>

        {{> vendorStamp}}

        <div class="letter-close">Yours Faithfully,</div>

        <div class="details">
          <div>Name: <strong>{{consumer_name}}</strong></div>
          <div>MSEDCL Consumer No: <strong>{{consumer_number}}</strong></div>
          <div>
            Meter Serial No: <strong>{{meter_serial_number}}</strong><span class="gap"></span>Make:
            <strong>{{meter_make}}</strong>
          </div>
          <div>Capacity: <strong>{{meter_capacity}}</strong></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
